pr_body:
This PR reduces the number of audit entries for bulk items in bulk shard requests.
Currently, each bulk item from every bulk shard request generates exactly one audit log entry.
This change reduces that to one audit log per action type (out of 4 possible) per bulk shard request.

For example:
```
curl -k -u "elastic:$ELASTIC_PASSWORD" -X POST "https://localhost:9200/_bulk?pretty" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d'
{ "index" : { "_index" : "<index-{now/d}>", "_id" : "1" } }
{ "field1" : "value1" }
{ "index" : { "_index" : "<alias-{now/d}>", "_id" : "2" } }
{ "field1" : "value2" }

{ "delete" : { "_index" : "<alias-{now/d}>", "_id" : "1" } }
{ "delete" : { "_index" : "<index-{now/d}>", "_id" : "2" } }

{ "create" : { "_index" : "<index-{now/d}>", "_id" : "1" } }
{ "field1" : "value1" }
{ "create" : { "_index" : "<alias-{now/d}>", "_id" : "2" } }
{ "field1" : "value2" }

{ "update" : {"_id" : "1", "_index" : "<alias-{now/d}>"} }
{ "doc" : {"field2" : "value1"} }
{ "update" : {"_id" : "2", "_index" : "<index-{now/d}>"} }
{ "doc" : {"field2" : "value2"} }
'
```
currently generates 8 audit log entries:
```
{... "action":"indices:data/write/index:op_type/index", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["index-2023.08.14"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/index:op_type/index", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["alias-2023.08.14"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/delete", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["alias-2023.08.14"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/delete", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["index-2023.08.14"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/index:op_type/create", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["index-2023.08.14"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/index:op_type/create", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["alias-2023.08.14"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/update", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["alias-2023.08.14"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/update", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["index-2023.08.14"]}

```
but following this PR it will change to 4 entries only:
```
{... "action":"indices:data/write/update", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["index-2023.08.16","alias-2023.08.16"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/index:op_type/create", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["index-2023.08.16","alias-2023.08.16"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/delete", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["index-2023.08.16","alias-2023.08.16"]}
{... "action":"indices:data/write/index:op_type/index", "request.name":"BulkItemRequest", "indices":["index-2023.08.16","alias-2023.08.16"]}
```

The reduction in log volume can be spectacular for bulk indexing requests with many items, especially if they're going into few shards and there are only few action types used (out of the 4 total).

Closes: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/66568

